    type: "section"
    title: "The Melody of the Fool"
    excerpt: "The notes twisted through the room the way a true count twists a clerk. Every step Boof took along the crack seemed to harmonize with the disagreement. The egg did not choose a slip. A cell keeps its own law; it does ..."
    route: ^[chapter/05/s05]{open}
  }
  s06: <
    handle: "custom-boof/06"
    type: "custom-boof"
    excerpt: "\"Why does this song feel so familiar?\" Boof wondered. Because she had smelled unreconciled books before. Because a dog who works for fruit knows when a total is a performance. The tune drew her onward, toward lanterns..."
